/resolve

# Generated Bible database. Rebuilt from data/ sources via `go run ./cmd/seed`
# and shipped as a build artifact, never committed. The -wal/-shm sidecars are
# only meaningful against the exact db file they were checkpointed from, so
# committing them risks handing out a mismatched, corrupt set.
data/bible.db
data/bible.db-shm
data/bible.db-wal